1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,530
Stop trusting the study ChatGPT gave you, Dad.

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:05,530
It says pancakes cure headaches. It's science.

3
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:06,990
Did you click it?

4
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,790
I don't click things.

5
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:10,880
Click it. Sometimes it goes nowhere.

6
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,280
So it lied.

7
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,640
It predicts what a source should look like. Very convincing!

8
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,840
That's lying with extra steps.

9
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,880
Fair. Turn on web search. Then click every link.

10
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,730
Can't open it? Can't put it on the menu.

11
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:25,530
Okay. No medical pancakes.

12
00:00:25,730 --> 00:00:27,940
New special: the Fact-Check Flapjack. Comment SOURCES.

13
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:30,940
Fine. Next time I click the study.

